  "description": "Syncfusion® ASP.NET Core Grid is a high-performance, feature-rich data grid control for displaying and manipulating tabular data. It supports virtual scrolling,paging, sorting, filtering, grouping, searching, inline editing (batch, dialog, inline),frozen rows and columns, column resizing, reordering, multi-column sorting, master-detail,aggregates, export to Excel/PDF/CSV, and accessibility.",
